fn gui_rgba8888_compositor_tile_rle_present_virtual_drain_result_error %fn GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRlePresentVirtualDrainErrorKind fn GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRlePresentVirtualDrain Result GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRlePresentVirtualDrain GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRlePresentVirtualDrainError \kind\drain:
