fn gui_rgba8888_compositor_tile_rle_present_virtual_drain_descriptor_surface_matches %fn &GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRlePresentVirtualDrain fn &GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRlePresentFrameDescriptor Result unit GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRlePresentVirtualDrainErrorKind \drain\descriptor:
    match gui_rgba8888_compositor_tile_rle_present_virtual_drain_surface drain:
        Option::Some surface:
